description:
TPO 01/03 - T6 (Lime) - reduce and shape crown by 2m cutting back to a side branch and leaving a flowing branch line without stumps. Remove major deadwood throughout whole crown. Remove basal and epicormic growth to crown break;
T7 (Lime) - remove remaining stem and grind;
T8 (Lime) - crown lift lower branches off roof and cut back from lamp column to provide 1m clearance. Crown lift canopy to balance. Reduce and shape crown by 1 - 1.5m;
T19, T20, T23, T24, T25 and T26 (Lime) - crown thin by up to 30% removing selected branches in the upper canopy. Remove major deadwood throughout whole crown. Crown lift 3m.  Remove basal and epicormic to crown break; and
T22 (Lime) - remove major deadwood throughout whole crown. Crown lift 3m. Remove basal and epicormic growth to crown break. Reduce and shape crown by up to 2m.  (Summary).
